{"parse": {"title": "三重赋格-06", "pageid": 110910, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E9%87%8D%E8%B5%8B%E6%A0%BC-05\" title=\"三重赋格-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">三重赋格-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E9%87%8D%E8%B5%8B%E6%A0%BC-07\" title=\"三重赋格-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">三重赋格</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.A9.BA.E5.BF.83.E4.BA.BA\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"空心人\">空心人</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 空心人</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Dead Man Walking</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>玩法前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>玩法后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu1\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我想你就是卡戎吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>是我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">威利：</div><div>布劳恩长官说你找到了一张相片，上面是一位抱着一束矢车菊的女性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>的确，这是你的相片吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">威利：</div><div>不，那是我的朋友，法比安的相片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……什么？法比安？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎打开笔记本，取出那张夹藏其中的相片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>那这位……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">威利：</div><div>这是安娜，法比安的妻子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>狭长的银色随着天空的方向蔓延，最后衔尾相接。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>安娜的确存在，法比安没有在妄想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">威利：</div><div>当然，我也是才知道法比安就在医院。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>但是他现在的情况有些糟糕，意志全消，像在等待死亡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面前的士兵指了指他手里的相片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">威利：</div><div>你把相片给他，告诉他，安娜在家里等他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵露出了肯定的笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">威利：</div><div>为了安娜，这小子十五岁就能揍倒两个兵痞，然后带着骨折的手去敲她的门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">威利：</div><div>他拿那副鼻青脸肿的样子告诉安娜，不会再有人敢对她动手动脚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我明白了，我会立刻去把相片给他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>准备动身的卡戎被远处的一声呼喝引得转动目光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>隔着沉浮的雾气，他缓慢地辨认出了向他跑来的士兵们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>卡戎！卡戎！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>快，你能不能去把弗兰兹找回来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅱ：</div><div>卡戎反应太迟缓，我都不敢想他要是遇上敌人该怎么办。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅱ：</div><div>还是等弗兰兹自己回来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>他已经一天半没有回来了！都能报失踪了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>弗兰兹怎么了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>他打听到消息，说相片的主人叫法比安，一周前在西南边的树林失踪了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">威利：</div><div>的确，法比安就是在那一带失踪的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅱ：</div><div>弗兰兹去找人了，说是赶紧看看有没有其他线索。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅱ：</div><div>明天他就要回去休假了，所以他心急。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅱ：</div><div>那片树林是危险地带，前几天一支敌人的侦查队摸进去了，我们的人跟他们起过冲突。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅱ：</div><div>该死，那群家伙像是打了窝的老鼠，我们一直没能把他们从那片树林里拽出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我可以去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅱ：</div><div>你认真的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>你以为我们为什么叫他卡戎？他每天走上前线埋葬遗体，至今毫发无伤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅱ：</div><div>……的确，冥界的船夫应该就是不会死的吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>无论如何，我会尽力把他找回来。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jiaoshulin_zao\"><img alt=\"jiaoshulin_zao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png/600px-Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png/900px-Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png/1200px-Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎跟着新鲜的行经痕迹抵达这里。蔓延的静谧，但更像野兽搏杀前的敛抑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>空气中的刺鼻气味源于子弹的击发，杂乱的草植意味着曾有过一场追逃或搏斗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但卡戎并不畏惧，他迈步向前，大衣摩擦枝叶，窸窣的声音在寂静中格外清晰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一步，两步，行过草木，即将行过那颗焦黑的橡树——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——一双手环过他的肩膀，借力将他狠狠带向树后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>是我——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵压低的声音里有怒气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>该死，你是在等敌人一枪打穿你的脑袋吗！明天就撤离了，我不想走前替你收尸！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我也不想替你收尸，弗兰兹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>相片的主人已经找到了，我们还是尽快回去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>敌人的侦察兵就在附近，你以为我是不想走吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一颗子弹擦着树皮打穿了卡戎露在树干外的的衣角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>啧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我们刚刚恐怕不该说话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>他早瞄上你了，只是等你把我引出来而已——蹲下走你不会吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>会，但我需要找到你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>弗兰兹，我可以把我们带出去——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一颗子弹就足以说明人类的脆弱和渺小。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>因此，卡戎没能明白弗兰兹面对危险时的本能为什么不是躲避——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>卡戎！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是从斜侧方直指卡戎的一道子弹轨迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>弗兰兹在捕捉到这一危险的瞬间，已经将卡戎扑倒在树丛中，随后又滚向一边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>弗兰兹？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>呼——该死！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>猩红的液体砸落在草叶上，卡戎伸手捂住他冒血的后背。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你受伤了，弗兰兹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——为什么要保护一个不再是士兵的士兵？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>弗兰兹没有理会自己的伤口，而是扬声用不熟练的语言呼喝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>神父！这个人是神父！不要伤及无辜！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回应他的是又一颗子弹，它打偏在附近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>……混账东西！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>交给我，弗兰兹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>你在说什么鬼话——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不顾阻拦，卡戎站了起来，接住了这一枪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在弗兰兹惊惧的目光中，子弹打在他们身后的树干上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎的外套上留下了一个空荡荡的弹孔，以示子弹曾经穿行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>这是，这是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个空洞。士兵突然意识到，在衣料的层层包裹下，酝酿的是一片空洞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们的神父，没有人类的血肉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>卡戎——你！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎已经看清了枝叶掩映下的敌人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>似乎是难以置信，似乎是惊慌失措。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>原本冷静而精准的敌人连开数枪，但也只是制造出了数个空洞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你走吧，你杀不死我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>片刻的迟疑之后，敌人起步逃奔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎想要翻出绷带，但弗兰兹站了起来，后退几步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>你是不死之身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的声音前所未有的冰冷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我已经死了，但即便如此，我也并非无坚不摧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>我不是在说这个，你的迟缓在这个时候只会让你显得更加可恨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>弗兰兹，我很抱歉让你受了伤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>卡戎，我们在这个该死的地狱里也相处得够久了吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>我尊重你像个怪人一样把自己包裹得严严实实，所以我从不问你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>但你为什么不告诉我？你想看我白白为你送死？还是我舍命救你的样子特别滑稽？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>不，我绝对没有那样的想法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我只是不知道该怎么说，我也没想过定义现在的自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>定义自己？你什么时候读书读傻了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>我们在说的事情和你定义什么狗屁自己有什么关系？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>我以为我们是可以交付后背的战友，我以为我们是互相信任的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>弗兰兹——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>——够了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>没必要再说了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>子弹的擦伤显然对士兵来说不算什么严重的伤口，他提起枪，独自转身离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎僵硬地伫立在丛林之中，缓慢地放下了刚刚抬起的手。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "三重赋格-06"}}